# Expected sha256 of the Aeneas release assets, keyed by <tag>/<asset> (sha256sum format).
# scripts/aeneas-install.sh checks the release bundle against this file and
# scripts/lean-guard.sh checks the Lean-library archive that Lake downloads; both fail on a
# mismatch or a missing entry. Changing the Aeneas `rev` in formal/lakefile.toml means adding
# the new tag's entries here in the same PR (docs/WORKFLOW_AND_PR_GUIDE.md, "Pinned toolchain").
